sequenceDiagram
    participant Konflux as Konflux Pipeline
    participant AIPCC as AIPCC PyPI Index<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Cachi2 as cachi2 Prefetch Cache
    participant Builder as Dockerfile Builder Stage
    participant Final as Final Image Stage
    participant Registry as Container Registry

    Note over Konflux,Registry: Flow 1: Universal Image Build

    Konflux->>AIPCC: Fetch Python packages<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+
    AIPCC-->>Cachi2: Prefetch to local cache
    Cachi2-->>Builder: pip install --no-index --find-links
    Builder->>Final: COPY site-packages from builder
    Final->>Registry: Push image

    participant TestRunner as E2E Test Runner
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant CRD as Training CRs<br/>TrainJob/PyTorchJob/RayJob

    Note over TestRunner,CRD: Flow 2: E2E Test Execution

    TestRunner->>K8sAPI: Create test namespace<br/>HTTPS/6443, TLS 1.2+, ServiceAccount
    TestRunner->>K8sAPI: Create CRs (TrainJob/PyTorchJob/RayJob)<br/>HTTPS/6443
    K8sAPI-->>CRD: CR created
    loop Poll until completion
        TestRunner->>K8sAPI: Watch CR status<br/>HTTPS/6443
        K8sAPI-->>TestRunner: Status update
    end
    TestRunner->>K8sAPI: Collect pod logs and events
    TestRunner->>K8sAPI: Delete test namespace (cleanup)

    participant User as User Browser
    participant Jupyter as JupyterLab<br/>8888/TCP HTTP
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over User,S3: Flow 3: Training Runtime (Workbench Mode)

    User->>Jupyter: Connect to notebook<br/>HTTP/8888, RHOAI auth
    Jupyter->>HF: Download models/datasets<br/>HTTPS/443, Bearer Token
    HF-->>Jupyter: Model artifacts
    Jupyter->>S3: Read/write training data<br/>HTTPS/443, Access Key
    S3-->>Jupyter: Data objects
